  "body": "A property of extraordinary rarity, where every day feels like a holiday.\r\n\r\nPositioned on one of Auckland’s most spectacular north-facing beaches, this exceptional waterfront property offers an enviable coastal lifestyle less than 40 minutes from the Auckland’s CBD.\r\n\r\nNestled at the gateway to the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, Stanmore Bay is renowned for its pristine white sands, crystal-clear waters, and sweeping views across the Hauraki Gulf to Kawau Island and beyond. It is a place where natural beauty and everyday living combine effortlessly.  Future accessibility will be further enhanced by the completion of the Penlink transport connection, currently under construction, strengthening links between the Hibiscus Coast and Auckland and further elevating the appeal of this sought-after location.\r\n\r\nPrivately elevated above the shoreline, this absolute beachfront residence has been thoughtfully redesigned and extensively renovated, including double glazing throughout, creating a remarkable family retreat that embraces both tranquillity and its unrivalled waterfront setting. With direct beach access and bordering a protected coastal reserve, the property enjoys the rare advantage of permanent privacy and uninterrupted views. Opportunities to secure a position of this calibre are seldom available.\r\n\r\nOriginally constructed in the early 1980s with a solid concrete block base, cedar weatherboard exterior, and concrete tile roof, the home offers generous accommodation across two levels. There are three spacious double bedrooms, two beautifully appointed bathrooms, a dedicated office, and a range of formal and informal living spaces designed for both relaxed family living and effortless entertaining.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the well-appointed kitchen connects seamlessly to expansive living areas and sun-drenched decks that frame the breathtaking coastal outlook.\r\n\r\nThe luxurious master suite occupies the main living level and features an impressive walk-in dressing room and elegant ensuite with twin vanities and a freestanding bath. On the lower level, are the additional bedrooms, a family bathroom, and a separate living area that flows onto an extensive decking, creating an ideal retreat for guests, extended family, or teenagers.\r\n\r\nPractical features include a generous laundry, guest powder room, workshop, abundant storage, and internal-access garaging for up to three vehicles.\r\n\r\nThe beautifully landscaped grounds are a standout feature, incorporating raised vegetable gardens, established plantings, a level lawn, and a private pathway leading directly to the beach. Mature pohutukawa trees line the coastline, attracting abundant native birdlife and creating a truly magical coastal environment.\r\n\r\nStanmore Bay offers an outstanding seaside lifestyle with parks, reserves, the Leisure Centre, quality schools, cafés, shops, and recreational facilities all within easy reach. Nearby Silverdale and the wider Whangaparaoa Peninsula provide every modern convenience, including shopping centres, major retail outlets, and highly regarded schooling options.\r\n\r\nWhether enjoyed as an exceptional permanent residence or the ultimate waterfront escape, this is a rare opportunity to secure an absolute beachfront property in one of Auckland’s most coveted coastal settings.\r\n\r\nPhone Libby, Mark or John to view this property prior to the forthcoming Auction",
